   networks using the evolutional scanning method. The basic task to be
   solved is to create a symbolic regression algorithm on principles of
   analytic programming, which will be capable of performing a convenient
   neural network synthesis. The main motivation here is the
   computerization of such synthesis and discovering so far unknown
   solutions.},
