Abstract = {In this paper, we propose a symbolic regression approach for data
   visualisation that is suited for classification tasks. Our algorithm
   seeks a visually and semantically interpretable lower dimensional
   representation of the given dataset that would increase classifier
   accuracy as well. This simultaneous identification of easily
   interpretable dimensionality reduction and improved classification
   accuracy relieves the user of the burden of experimenting with the many
